{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An epic snowball fight between 2-4 players, both online and local multiplayer. Grow your snowball and use different power-up's to knock your friends out! Are you ready to Brawll?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FUN COMBAT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>&quot;SNOWBALL INCOMINGGG!&quot;</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throw your snowball to knock them out. But don't miss, you are extremely vulnerable without a snowball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/gif3.gif?t=1750428527\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>&quot;FULL CHARGEEE!&quot;</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get in a head-to-head battle and headbutt your friends like a stubborn goat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/gif1.gif?t=1750428527\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">INTERACT WITH THE MAP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The map is yours to get the upper hand. Use it and surprise your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>&quot;PORTALS!&quot;</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the portals located in the map to hit them when they are not expecting! (Have you tried throwing your snowball to the portal?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/gif2.gif?t=1750428527\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>&quot;OMG! MAP IS CHANGING&quot;</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hit the bell, move the blocks to have some unexpected falls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>&quot;An animal takes a step and falls from the moved block you think that of me? No, I am the one who hits the bell.&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">                                                     <strong>- Emperor Puffin</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/gif4.gif?t=1750428527\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Football Mode</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dribble through your friends, and control the ball with your own balls!!! Teamwork is important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/gif6.gif?t=1750428527\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MOST IMPORTANTLY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't forget to have fun and show your friends that you are better than them in video games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/gif7.gif?t=1750428527\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2247510?t=1750428527","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/9ff707c8a7080ca6b178afe61ab0e325bf9da93e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750428527","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/603aa5a10610ee10738a41cc21ad19bf903df262/capsule_231x8